3:T53f,<h2><span class="ident">What is</span> The Voice of God?</h2>
<p>For many years I’ve been providing Voice of God announcements for major live events, concerts, award shows and brand experiences.</p>

<p>I’ve voiced shows for ITV, TV Choice, Butlins, Bestway, the National History Museum and more.  
I’m also the big “competition voice” on <a href="/britains-got-talent-competition-voice" class="isred">Britain’s Got Talent</a> – a huge 2025 credit.</p>

<p>When <a href="/maskedsinger-voiceover" class="isred">The Masked Singer</a> arrived at Butlins, they needed the full Voice of God treatment. I stepped in to bring the live show together.</p>

<p>I’ve also supplied the booming, festive Voice of God for large-scale Christmas events, including <a href="/christmas-party-fireworks-santa-voice" class="isred">Santa-voiced fireworks displays</a> where I voiced every announcement throughout the show.</p>

<!-- Mini Player -->
<div style="margin:20px 0;">
  <audio controls style="width:100%; max-width:420px;">
    <source src="/assets/audio/voice-of-god-showreel-voiceover-guy-harris.mp3" type="audio/mpeg">
    Your browser does not support the audio element.
  </audio>
  <p style="font-size:0.9em; opacity:0.8; margin-top:5px;">
    Voice of God Voiceover Showreel – Guy Harris (1m 27s)
  </p>
</div>4:T49e,<h2><span class="ident">Oh my… Voice of God</span> – It’s The Big Weekend</h2>

<p>My Voice of God delivery has been used on BBC Radio 1, Radio 2 and by top imaging teams for promos, trails and arena intros.</p>

<p>I voiced the deep, impactful announcements for <a href="https://soundcloud.com/voiceoverguy/bbc-radio-1-big-weekend" target="_blank" class="isred" rel="noopener noreferrer">BBC Radio 1’s Big Weekend</a> and the live tour version of <a href="/saturday-night-takeaway-voice" class="isred">Ant & Dec’s Saturday Night Takeaway</a>.</p>

<p>Event organisers also hire me for specialist roles, including:</p>
<ul>
  <li><a href="/qatar-drone-race-psg-voiceover" class="isred">PSG Qatar Drone Race – Football Style Commentary</a></li>
  <li><a href="/european-collaboration-summit-patrick-stewart-voiceover" class="isred">Patrick Stewart style announcer – European Collaboration Summit</a></li>
  <li><a href="/ninja-warrior-uk-fitbit-sponsor-bumpers" class="isred">Ninja Warrior UK – Sponsor bumpers</a></li>
</ul>

<p>If you’ve ever stayed at Butlins, there’s a high chance you’ve heard my Voice of God echoing through their venues.</p>5:T4c3,<h2>Contact <span class="ident">God</span> for Your Event</h2>

<p>I’ve voiced major events for Asperity, BBC Radio 1, National Fitness Awards, Alhambra Theatre, Jewsons, Walkers, Butlins, Warners, RBS and many more.</p>

<p>
Brands rely on me for tight, perfectly timed delivery – whether pre-recorded or live.  
The team behind <a href="/britains-got-talent-competition-voice" class="isred">Britain’s Got Talent</a> trusted me for their competition-voice segments, and event organisers return year after year for Christmas announcements, award show intros and gala ceremonies.
</p>

<p>
Technology allows for last-minute changes, same-day audio delivery and seamless integration into your event.  
So don’t panic — I’ve got it covered.
</p>

<p>
For live award ceremonies, arena tours and corporate shows, visit my dedicated
<a href="https://voiceofgod.co.uk" class="isred" target="_blank" title="Voice of God Announcer" rel="noopener noreferrer">Voice of God announcer site</a>
for examples and booking information.
</p>

<p>
<strong><a href="/contact-guy" class="isred" title="Contact Guy Harris">Get in touch today</a></strong>
and let me know what needs hosting or voicing.
</p>0:["T-vE3jocQsMrcy4PkMQjv",[[["",{"children":["voice-of-god",{"children":["__PAGE__",{}]}]},"$undefined","$undefined",true],["",{"children":["voice-of-god",{"children":["__PAGE__",{},[["$L1",["$","main",null,{"className":"inner-page","children":[["$","section",null,{"className":"inner-hero","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-container","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h1><span class=\"ident\">Voice of God</span> Announcer & Voiceover</h1>\r\n<p>The Voice of God is the powerful, unmistakable live event announcer voice that guides audiences through major events, theatre shows, awards ceremonies and arena tours.</p>\r\n<p>I’m the voice behind: “Ladies and Gentlemen, please take your seats…” and dozens of other iconic announcements heard across the UK and beyond.</p>\r\n<p>From huge arena productions to corporate keynotes, brands trust me to deliver impactful, perfectly timed announcements that lift the entire event.</p>"}}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-bar"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-parallax","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-container","style":{"paddingBottom":0},"children":["$","$L2",null,{}]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-parallax","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-container","children":[[["$","div","0",{"className":"inner-row","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$3"}}],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":["$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/e0vZ9cxdilo","title":"YouTube video","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}],"$undefined","$undefined"]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"inner-row reverse","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":[["$","div"